    "Si paga con i tuoi crediti OpenRouter. Se su OpenRouter usi anche chiavi tue (BYOK), attiva «Never use shared capacity» su ciascuna: altrimenti, quando una fallisce, OpenRouter ripiega da solo sui suoi crediti." : {
      "comment" : "Settings › Models: how OpenRouter is paid and the BYOK option Bubo cannot set.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You pay with your OpenRouter credits. If you also use your own keys (BYOK) on OpenRouter, turn on “Never use shared capacity” for each: otherwise, when one fails, OpenRouter falls back to its credits on its own."
          }
        }
      }
    },
